WEBVTT

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.780
Thank you for coming. I'm Alan L. Byrne.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.290
I'd like to explain the situation to you in my father's place.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:24.710
Please do.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:29.890
The place of arrest...

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.970
Charlotte, my younger sister, disappeared from the bedroom of the mansion.

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.270
This is the picture of her daughter.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:41.260
It is a noble carriage that several people are witnessing the four-legged black carriage run to the north.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.740
Charlotte was kidnapped by a vampire.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:52.280
I gathered about 20 search teams and chased her.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.400
If I don't do it...

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:11.100
It's a $500,000 deposit.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:16.580
If you bring your sister back, I'll pay you $10,000,000 in compensation.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.180
If you want to get it, hurry up and go.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.520
I hired hunters other than you.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.490
You'll get in the way.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:25.770
It might be too late.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.580
I already have a daughter.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.600
What would you do if you were already under the command of the nobility?

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:36.070
I'll save you before that!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.700
I'll pay you back for that!

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:38.520
Calm down.

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:45.820
Charlotte is an irreplaceable, precious daughter to me.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:50.680
The way she treats everyone is like a noble virgin.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.430
Lend me your strength.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:59.450
And if I have to have a daughter, I will not suffer.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.980
N-no way! You hired him to kill Charlotte!?

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:07.050
I'm not kidding! You hired Danpil and his sister to-

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.230
Can you do it?

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:10.860
To kill that girl who turned into a vampire?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.960
It's very...

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.870
The reward is 20 million dollars.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.000
You can't get any more than that.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:23.460
You bastard!

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:25.420
Stop it!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.370
Let's make a promise, 20 million Dallas.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.250
Save my daughter from her cursed fate.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.400
It's a four-legged black horse.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:25.400
Why are you hiding it?

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:28.290
Hmph.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:02.600
Thank you.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.500
All the people in the village will be turned into vampires.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:12.060
It's his job.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:16.650
I won't lose. I'll make it work.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.140
God's protection.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.510
Leila...

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:24.870
Don't worry. It'll be over soon.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.050
There is no reason to let you go.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:45.160
What is it? You don't want to survive again?

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:51.690
I'm going.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:04.360
That's it.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.220
Well done, well done.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.980
It seems that you have the same business.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.130
And you sell the same prey.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:40.780
That's right.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.900
I'm Volgoff.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.140
Volgoff Marcus.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.180
Let me hear your name.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:47.280
D.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:55.340
So that's how he is.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.400
Dampierre's hunter.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:58.650
As rumored.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.270
Well well, did you have a good time too, big brother?

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.200
You don't have to be so impressed with the business.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.000
That's right.

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.680
If it weren't for us, he might have been killed by them.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.290
I'll get rid of that and teach him a lesson.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:19.550
Do you know the story of the snake bird and the stag beetle?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.450
What's that?

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:29.580
The stag beetle runs around every morning and evening to collect food.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:34.980
However, when a snake bird is full of food, it can't stand to look at it.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:39.800
So, one day, a birdie thought about it.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:44.590
He said that when he was born, he would definitely become a snake bird.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:04.410
Don't be in such a hurry. Let's get the food ready.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:09.610
What's wrong, Rayla?

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.260
Those are the brothers who lead the evil Takai.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.780
They're a bunch of liars.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.340
Tio, it's better to quit this job quickly.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:57.720
While I'm climbing, he can't move, so I'll catch up with him.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.020
What the...

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.040
What?

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:06.820
The park is moving.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:14.090
What is it?

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:23.610
I'm going to die.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:28.290
I'm not going to die.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.610
I'm not going to die.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.570
Stop it!

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:36.760
Hey, wait a minute!

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:37.500
Wait a minute!

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:38.140
D!

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.680
I'm sorry for being such a troublemaker!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.440
Well, well, I'm a little tired of being in this body.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.550
But I'm not bored with you.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:25.910
That's great.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:29.060
Next time, I'll go to the noble shelter.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.900
There are many things left in the forest.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:17.520
Find the exit.

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:20.770
Understood.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:35.180
No, he's old.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.180
What's he go?

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:54.390
Oh my god, that's it, yeah.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:06.980
I want you to return my daughter to me.

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:09.680
I took it because I wanted it.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.500
You should do the same.

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.710
I want you to be able to face the nobles at night.

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:29.440
Dampierre's hunter has an excellent skillful man.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.440
So you're D. I've always wanted to see you.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:37.500
I'm Maiel Link.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:44.700
I'm no longer a nobleman, and I have no place for humans.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.490
What's wrong with you? You don't look like yourself.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:09.770
That girl is a nobleman.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:15.580
Her body and mind are already controlled by him.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.540
She's just like an eggplant.

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:19.810
I knew it. It was too late.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.320
It won't last long as it is.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.890
It's delicious, isn't it?

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:42.760
The blood of a young girl.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.000
The scent of that blood.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.380
You don't like it, do you?

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:59.520
But my throat is dry.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.280
Do you want me to heal you?

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:24.820
What are you trying to do?

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:29.080
I took out the fragments that had been eaten by the body and disinfected them.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.220
That's all.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:35.830
You didn't ask me to do it, but you really touched my body.

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:38.800
What the hell is Dampir going to do?

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.370
If you get a fever, pull it back.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.010
It's unnecessary care.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:48.180
A hunter will not go to a daughter who calls her mother's name after her death.

00:21:04.604 --> 00:21:04.864
Amen.

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:08.570
I should have left that little girl alone.

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.440
It's become troublesome.

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:23.360
Is it really here?

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:27.790
There is one thing that a noble who was chased by a tough hunter must do.

00:22:28.470 --> 00:22:29.680
No doubt.

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:31.650
Barbaroi, huh?

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:33.180
Just like my brother said.

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:36.190
But I don't want to fight the people over there.

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:46.050
Does it hurt, Veila?

00:22:46.660 --> 00:22:47.940
Does it hurt?

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:49.040
You're injured.

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:51.750
It's okay, Brother Glove.

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.820
You must be tired after a long journey.

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:58.350
It's good to sleep a little.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:03.180
You didn't heal that wound yourself, did you?

00:23:03.220 --> 00:23:08.030
You're a weirdo.

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:14.020
But to us, you're just as annoying as you are.

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:20.730
Of course. I don't tell anyone about it.

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:34.560
I didn't want to, but why did you stop?

00:23:35.070 --> 00:23:37.810
I don't know. I'll ask you in person.

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:41.670
Laila, wait in the glove until you figure out what's going on.

00:23:41.810 --> 00:23:42.210
Okay.

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:15.810
I'm counting on you to help me.

00:24:35.470 --> 00:24:53.230
This is the end.

00:24:53.390 --> 00:24:55.440
You're kidding me.

00:24:55.680 --> 00:24:57.500
Don't be careless.

00:25:00.090 --> 00:25:02.090
Hehehehe...

00:25:02.090 --> 00:25:05.400
Hehehehe...

00:25:06.710 --> 00:25:10.460
I've never seen such a big step.

00:25:11.140 --> 00:25:13.680
I'll try it with the Ujimushi of Mino-Horoshirasu.

00:25:14.060 --> 00:25:19.270
I'll mix the blood of the demons for 5,000 years.

00:25:19.780 --> 00:25:22.350
Like a Barbaroi in the dark.

00:25:22.530 --> 00:25:26.420
I wonder if your skills will work.

00:25:37.550 --> 00:25:37.870
Here it is!

00:26:00.540 --> 00:26:01.240
Be careful.

00:26:01.740 --> 00:26:04.830
Shadow? What do you mean?

00:26:08.040 --> 00:26:08.950
Nolto!

00:26:09.090 --> 00:26:19.920
What the hell did you do?

00:26:20.240 --> 00:26:23.320
He's dead!

00:26:23.760 --> 00:26:24.380
Don't be stupid!

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:26.060
Edit this out!

00:26:26.280 --> 00:26:27.020
Nolto!

00:26:27.240 --> 00:26:29.190
This is how much I've been hurt!

00:26:30.890 --> 00:26:31.590
I can't do it!

00:26:31.750 --> 00:26:34.160
This is ridiculous!

00:26:36.260 --> 00:26:37.400
What the hell!

00:26:37.400 --> 00:26:51.100
Are you going to get into Alvarei's village from the front?

00:26:52.460 --> 00:26:54.220
I don't think you're crazy.

00:26:54.380 --> 00:26:58.060
Is your head just to put on a hat?

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:00.580
Use your brain!

00:27:00.820 --> 00:27:04.050
Can't you say something?

00:27:18.900 --> 00:27:21.670
Hunter D, I'm here because I need you.

00:27:21.930 --> 00:27:23.290
I want you to buy something.

00:27:54.090 --> 00:27:55.890
Looks like you're having a good time, Ichirika.

00:28:10.040 --> 00:28:11.940
Oh, you've come down from the mountain.

00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:13.270
You're being polite to the elderly.

00:28:15.450 --> 00:28:20.640
I want you to give me the girl in that carriage.

00:28:22.640 --> 00:28:28.700
You're a brave and beautiful young man.

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:36.900
I would like to say so, but we have already received the protection of that nobleman on the request of the monkey lord.

00:28:37.140 --> 00:28:40.280
That too is one million dollars worth of gold or one hundred pieces.

00:28:40.540 --> 00:28:41.780
Will you be able to pay that much?

00:28:42.760 --> 00:28:45.920
If I pay, will I betray that client?

00:28:47.690 --> 00:28:50.530
It's a pleasure, it's a pleasure, it's a pleasure at all.

00:28:52.810 --> 00:28:56.570
Since thousands of years ago, the villagers of Barbaroi were fed by that vampire king,

00:28:58.030 --> 00:28:59.550
we have become the shadow of the nobleman.

00:29:00.060 --> 00:29:01.300
You know that I've been using it for a long time, don't you?

00:29:02.360 --> 00:29:05.520
And you're talking to us like that.

00:29:06.800 --> 00:29:12.500
I've seen a lot of Lampere, but it's the first time I've seen someone like you.

00:29:12.700 --> 00:29:14.240
I wish I could die.

00:29:14.800 --> 00:29:16.540
I really wish I could die.

00:29:16.740 --> 00:29:18.760
But I'm not going to let you go from here.

00:29:20.140 --> 00:29:21.740
I'll take your life.

00:29:23.060 --> 00:29:28.260
All the people lined up here have learned the skill of the strong point.

00:29:30.670 --> 00:29:33.790
No matter how good a hunter he is, it's impossible to defeat everyone.

00:29:34.530 --> 00:29:44.560
He's an idiot.

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:46.940
I'm going to beat him up.

00:29:46.980 --> 00:29:50.230
Bro, are you still there?

00:29:50.410 --> 00:29:54.420
I'm sorry, Grobo.

00:29:54.560 --> 00:29:59.070
If I don't borrow your power, I'll avenge Nolto.

00:30:00.030 --> 00:30:03.480
I know, brother.

00:30:04.050 --> 00:30:05.810
I'm counting on you.

00:30:07.250 --> 00:30:08.070
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:30:08.130 --> 00:30:09.320
Be sure to come back.

00:30:09.460 --> 00:30:09.800
Okay?

00:30:10.380 --> 00:30:20.180
If you kill me, a few people will be lost.

00:30:20.760 --> 00:30:23.010
It can't be helped.

00:30:24.150 --> 00:30:24.550
But...

00:30:24.550 --> 00:30:25.310
In the name of Barbaroy,

00:30:25.410 --> 00:30:28.890
I'll be able to save a single hunter who has a dirty wound.

00:30:28.890 --> 00:30:29.320
Thank you for watching!

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:33.560
I tried to get rid of all the people. If that's okay with you, I'll be your partner.

00:30:34.250 --> 00:30:37.110
Oh, I see.

00:30:37.330 --> 00:30:39.340
You're good at following me.

00:30:39.540 --> 00:30:40.990
You're more and more fun.

00:30:41.690 --> 00:30:45.550
Master Choro, that's exactly what he said.

00:30:46.530 --> 00:30:51.010
Leave this to the three of us who came to guard.

00:30:51.190 --> 00:30:54.510
If you're going to get on with it from the beginning,

00:30:54.930 --> 00:30:58.130
I'll get on with it, Ikkyo.

00:30:58.230 --> 00:30:59.450
No way.

00:31:00.920 --> 00:31:03.540
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:31:03.800 --> 00:31:08.740
All we can do is do our job, and that's all we can do.

00:31:08.800 --> 00:31:10.350
It's our own way of doing things.

00:31:10.750 --> 00:31:18.930
What the hell are you talking about?

00:31:41.040 --> 00:31:42.480
Thank you for watching!

00:32:05.240 --> 00:32:06.060
This way, this way!

00:32:39.210 --> 00:32:39.950
I'll get you back, Groh!

00:32:40.050 --> 00:32:50.870
B, you're a great guy.

00:32:51.740 --> 00:32:53.080
But you're not going to win against the three Barbarians.

00:32:56.320 --> 00:32:57.440
It's a shame.

00:33:30.020 --> 00:33:42.420
I won't let you move a single finger from now on.

00:33:42.420 --> 00:33:43.150
I won't let you go until you're finished.

00:33:44.570 --> 00:33:59.200
You're a coward.

00:34:01.180 --> 00:34:01.380
What?

00:34:02.120 --> 00:34:02.580
Wait!

00:34:07.040 --> 00:34:11.990
Kyle, where did that woman go?

00:34:12.530 --> 00:34:14.680
I think she got caught in the wheel.

00:34:15.480 --> 00:34:16.160
That's not true.

00:34:16.700 --> 00:34:17.510
Search carefully.

00:34:54.350 --> 00:34:55.130
As usual, it's rough.

00:34:55.560 --> 00:34:57.770
Let's enjoy it a little more slowly.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:01.180
You take care of the cleaning.

00:35:02.190 --> 00:35:04.550
Thank you, Carolil-neesan.

00:35:04.610 --> 00:35:08.080
Damn, monsters.

00:35:08.640 --> 00:35:10.640
Everyone, are you okay?

00:35:10.900 --> 00:35:13.320
Brother Frog was thrown out.

00:35:17.040 --> 00:35:19.300
Where's Frog?

00:35:19.910 --> 00:35:23.610
He's nearby.

00:35:32.360 --> 00:35:32.820
O-Oi!

00:35:32.900 --> 00:35:39.180
I've completely destroyed it.

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:41.040
Get out of here now!

00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:42.640
I know you're in there!

00:35:43.420 --> 00:35:46.060
I can smell your stinky teeth all the way here!

00:35:46.620 --> 00:35:49.550
I'll kill you right away, so pray for me!

00:35:56.940 --> 00:35:58.280
Finally, you're here.

00:36:04.190 --> 00:36:05.290
Who the hell are you?

00:36:37.420 --> 00:36:38.880
Beware of the shadows.

00:36:39.260 --> 00:36:40.390
I see.

00:36:40.810 --> 00:36:45.370
Kyle, don't move a step further.

00:36:45.510 --> 00:36:46.610
Don't say that.

00:36:46.770 --> 00:36:48.320
It's something I'm not good at.

00:36:48.720 --> 00:36:49.680
I don't want to talk to you.

00:36:51.280 --> 00:36:51.880
What did you say?

00:37:32.750 --> 00:37:35.470
This is no good. I can't run anymore.

00:37:35.850 --> 00:37:37.570
What are you going to do?

00:37:38.630 --> 00:37:40.670
Bro, are you listening?

00:37:43.140 --> 00:37:45.870
What do you think? How's the globe?

00:37:46.390 --> 00:37:47.480
It's not very good.

00:37:48.630 --> 00:37:50.160
What's wrong, Brother Volkov?

00:37:50.580 --> 00:37:54.530
Oh, I'm thinking about it.

00:37:54.730 --> 00:37:57.830
How far is that car trying to escape?

00:38:00.960 --> 00:38:03.640
Go out to the port of Evral and cross the sea by boat.

00:38:03.840 --> 00:38:05.100
Isn't it like diving into the mountains of Granars?

00:38:07.100 --> 00:38:08.830
I hope so.

00:38:11.310 --> 00:38:13.140
Well, anyway, it's a fuel supply.

00:38:13.700 --> 00:38:16.480
If it's a city of Gariusha, it's a long way to go.

00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:18.340
Kairu, go with Ray.

00:38:18.900 --> 00:38:20.270
I'll repair the car body.

00:39:07.720 --> 00:39:09.450
D, why don't you take a break?

00:39:10.130 --> 00:39:14.650
No matter how much you say you're different from the other Danpils, I'll answer you.

00:39:14.910 --> 00:39:21.140
Listen to what I have to say sometimes.

00:39:21.420 --> 00:39:27.640
I know that you're going to be a Yoko Sho, but I don't want to be a Himono either.

00:39:42.480 --> 00:39:43.740
Okay, how much is it?

00:39:44.100 --> 00:39:44.900
It's... it's fine.

00:39:45.420 --> 00:39:46.460
Don't refuse.

00:39:46.940 --> 00:39:47.380
Here.

00:39:47.990 --> 00:39:48.810
Th-thank you.

00:39:49.010 --> 00:39:50.000
Let's go.

