I committed a grave sin.

01:11:17.140 --> 01:11:20.880
I took away the lives of a large number of people who had nothing to do with it.

01:11:23.710 --> 01:11:25.640
That's my fault for those villagers.

01:11:30.320 --> 01:11:34.060
No, we just tried to pass through that village.

01:11:34.400 --> 01:11:39.460
But the villagers were too afraid of you and pointed their guns at you.

01:11:40.460 --> 01:11:45.020
And you, wearing a gun, couldn't hold your anger and your fangs.

01:11:47.740 --> 01:11:48.620
You're a noble.

01:11:50.140 --> 01:11:53.740
If I hadn't loved you, that wouldn't have happened.

01:11:55.280 --> 01:11:56.540
I can't understand it anymore.

01:11:57.360 --> 01:11:59.880
But no matter how much you curse,

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:05.220
I don't care how hard it is. You are my everything.

01:12:16.960 --> 01:12:19.160
Let's talk slowly on our journey to the stars.

01:12:23.610 --> 01:12:28.380
If I don't finish what I left behind here, I won't be able to get out of here until I get back.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:30.600
Good.

01:13:09.564 --> 01:13:09.804
T.

01:13:30.636 --> 01:13:32.636
You

01:14:23.580 --> 01:14:25.580
Roti

01:15:00.380 --> 01:15:02.000
Leila, you can't go.

01:15:02.260 --> 01:15:05.630
Something bad is going to happen to me.

01:15:05.630 --> 01:15:06.370
Feel it.

01:15:06.710 --> 01:15:07.590
I understand.

01:15:08.030 --> 01:15:10.290
It's true, Leila.

01:15:10.450 --> 01:15:12.000
I'll be back for sure.

01:15:31.530 --> 01:15:40.940
I got it, kidakoto.

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:34.740
You must be jealous of me, the me who gave birth to you.

01:17:02.240 --> 01:17:02.540
Gold!

01:17:03.260 --> 01:17:04.640
Kyler!

01:17:06.820 --> 01:17:07.600
What the hell?

01:17:40.748 --> 01:17:41.908
What are you doing?

01:17:42.380 --> 01:17:43.180
At a place like this.

01:17:45.484 --> 01:17:47.484
Thank you for watching.

01:17:47.916 --> 01:17:49.916
I don't want to let you go.

01:18:04.920 --> 01:18:10.940
Forgive me, D. I met my father.

01:18:11.840 --> 01:18:16.880
Please forgive me.

01:18:30.090 --> 01:18:30.670
I'm glad you didn't regret it.

01:19:00.510 --> 01:19:02.770
Hahahaha...

01:19:02.770 --> 01:19:13.460
I don't know what you saw, but you cut something that shouldn't be cut.

01:19:13.920 --> 01:19:15.520
Poor thing.

01:19:16.400 --> 01:19:17.740
Where did you take your daughter?

01:19:19.420 --> 01:19:19.860
Hehehe...

01:19:19.860 --> 01:19:27.320
Brother...

01:19:30.760 --> 01:19:31.700
Leave him alone.

01:19:31.960 --> 01:19:35.580
Leila, do you have a good relationship with this Danpeer?

01:19:36.380 --> 01:19:37.880
Don't be stupid.

01:19:38.200 --> 01:19:39.570
This is not the time to do this.

01:19:40.330 --> 01:19:40.810
What?

01:19:42.090 --> 01:19:51.200
Throw him away!

01:20:02.720 --> 01:20:03.220
Throw away the slasher!

01:20:03.640 --> 01:20:05.040
To him.

01:20:05.280 --> 01:20:09.120
Take this!

01:20:13.980 --> 01:20:16.100
This woman's blood belongs to me.

01:20:16.300 --> 01:20:18.120
Take this!

01:21:42.160 --> 01:21:42.760
It's finally over.

01:21:43.360 --> 01:21:51.060
It's the death of the camera that came out of the body of the dead.

01:21:51.660 --> 01:21:54.380
It hits as well as I expected.

01:22:30.320 --> 01:22:32.100
I get sad when I look at you.

01:22:33.100 --> 01:22:34.620
Do you want to be that much of a human?

01:22:37.560 --> 01:22:42.090
Humans are inferior creatures.

01:22:42.430 --> 01:22:45.930
For us, they are nothing more or nothing less than food.

01:22:45.930 --> 01:22:48.770
For humans, livestock is like that.

01:22:49.250 --> 01:22:50.880
The livestock eat the grass.

01:22:51.600 --> 01:22:53.120
Humans eat the livestock.

01:22:53.760 --> 01:22:55.640
And the nobles eat humans.

01:22:57.240 --> 01:22:58.240
This is the life on this earth.

01:23:00.700 --> 01:23:04.000
Why do you go against the rules of the world?

01:23:05.330 --> 01:23:21.700
Those who have been taken away must accept their own destruction.

01:23:22.620 --> 01:23:26.840
In this world, everything is in the hands of the dead.

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:35.290
You are the one who is in charge of our family's future, aren't you?

01:23:35.590 --> 01:23:36.960
You too.

01:23:38.010 --> 01:23:40.930
That is what led me to ruin.

01:23:41.330 --> 01:23:47.970
Oza, I will awaken your true form.

01:23:49.110 --> 01:23:51.270
And you will be my servant.

01:24:31.210 --> 01:24:32.250
I-I can't believe it...

01:24:33.730 --> 01:24:43.340
That's enough.

01:25:00.220 --> 01:25:03.210
Who the hell are you?

01:25:06.660 --> 01:25:09.680
That vampire king!

01:25:41.040 --> 01:25:41.380
See you later!

01:26:01.690 --> 01:26:03.920
Let me stay like this for a little while.

01:26:09.860 --> 01:26:15.980
Now you can see the dream you've been dreaming of at the end of the starry night.

01:26:17.010 --> 01:26:18.980
That's it.

01:26:30.190 --> 01:26:36.300
The capital of the night is far away, but if it's just the two of you, I'll be there in no time.

01:26:36.480 --> 01:26:39.090
Will you come with me, Charlotte?

01:27:07.640 --> 01:27:09.700
Let's go, Charlotte.

01:27:18.420 --> 01:27:20.360
This is the end of your journey.

01:27:20.360 --> 01:27:25.050
Take your daughter's body and your life.

01:27:33.610 --> 01:27:35.610
So this is your fate and my fate.

01:27:35.890 --> 01:27:41.510
But D, keep this in your heart.

01:27:41.930 --> 01:27:45.890
One day, you won't be able to stand it,

01:27:46.010 --> 01:27:48.510
and the time will come when you can put a human on its fangs.

01:27:50.840 --> 01:27:51.840
No one can defeat this Saga.

01:27:53.520 --> 01:27:55.320
Then I will be the one to be chased.

01:27:56.390 --> 01:27:57.150
That's all.

01:28:33.100 --> 01:28:33.400
Thank you.

01:29:09.720 --> 01:29:12.220
I will not kill any more.

01:29:16.950 --> 01:29:17.690
You think so, don't you?

01:30:31.080 --> 01:30:32.540
The mark of this sword is the proof.

01:30:32.820 --> 01:30:35.720
My work is done.

01:31:49.990 --> 01:31:51.250
You can take me to a nearby town.

01:31:53.520 --> 01:31:58.010
I gave you the reward.

01:32:00.090 --> 01:32:01.150
But this time only.

01:32:01.230 --> 01:32:03.660
I won't do it next time though.

01:33:01.470 --> 01:33:08.080
No, no, no, no, no!

01:34:11.300 --> 01:34:19.650
We are not great, but we are not small. We are far away, but we live again.

01:34:20.910 --> 01:34:23.520
That is why I call you to the far away world.

01:34:24.180 --> 01:34:28.620
While wandering the earth, I can not answer your requests.

01:34:31.240 --> 01:34:37.400
I look at the shadow of the world with sorrow, but I fear nothing.

01:34:38.100 --> 01:34:43.090
I know the words of silence, and I see what is invisible.

01:34:43.790 --> 01:34:51.000
We are difficult, we are not difficult, we are light.

01:35:00.540 --> 01:35:03.910
Are you a friend of Grandma Leila?

01:35:05.040 --> 01:35:12.540
I know you.

01:35:12.680 --> 01:35:15.320
I heard something from Grandma.

01:35:16.150 --> 01:35:17.490
Come to my house.

01:35:17.790 --> 01:35:19.390
Your father and friends will be happy.

01:35:19.810 --> 01:35:20.310
Okay?

01:35:21.380 --> 01:35:23.960
I'll accept that feeling.

01:35:24.760 --> 01:35:25.000
Why?

01:35:26.150 --> 01:35:27.270
It's right there.

01:35:32.490 --> 01:35:35.230
I just came to fulfill the promise I made a long time ago.

01:35:35.370 --> 01:35:38.940
I didn't have to pluck flowers.

01:35:39.720 --> 01:35:41.800
All I needed was to know that.

01:35:45.120 --> 01:35:45.800
Even though it's there...

01:35:45.800 --> 01:35:52.050
But, thank you for coming.

01:36:00.990 --> 01:36:14.030
You are also a guy who is surprisingly 5 cm.

01:36:15.310 --> 01:36:18.230
Well, there is a point for anyone.

01:37:00.960 --> 01:37:01.360
We'll be right back.
